          "Toki Pona has two number systems.",
          "",
          "THE VAGUE SYSTEM (most common):",
          "wan = one          tu = two",
          "mute = many, several   ale = all",
          "",
          "THE CLASSIC COUNTING SYSTEM (exact,",
          "built up by addition):",
          "luka = five      tu wan = 3 (2+1)",
          "tu tu = 4 (2+2)    luka luka = 10",
          "",
          "ORDINALS: put nanpa before a number:",
          "nanpa wan = first",
          "nanpa tu  = second"
        ],
        "pronunciation": "nanpa wan"
      },
