        "content": [
          "COLOR AND THE SMALL-TOOLKIT IDEA:",
          "",
          "Toki Pona names only five colors:",
          "loje = red        jelo = yellow",
          "laso = blue/green   walo = white",
          "pimeja = black",
          "",
          "kule itself just means 'color' or",
          "'kind' in general — there's no lone",
          "word for 'purple' or 'orange'.",
          "",
          "That's the whole design: a small",
          "toolkit, not a big dictionary.",
          "Context and combination build all",
          "the shades English splits apart."
        ],
        "pronunciation": "kule"
      }
